{"type": "message", "id": "d29880f1", "parentId": "43e7ca40", "timestamp": "2026-04-04T16:25:41.430Z", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "[Sat 2026-04-04 16:24 UTC] Please answer the following legal multiple-choice question. Write your answer to `answer.txt` in the workspace.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: `answer.txt` should contain ONLY the option letter(s) (e.g., `A`, `BC`, `ABCD`). Do not include any explanations, numbering, or extra text.\n\n**Question**:\n关于司法职业，下列哪一选项是错误的?\nA: 检察官不得兼任人民代表大会常务委员会的组成人员，不得兼任行政机关、审判机关以及企业、事业单位的职务，不得兼任律师。\nB: 担任最高人民法院法官应当从事法律工作满3年。\nC: 犯罪嫌疑人被侦查机关第一次讯问或者采取强制措施之日起，受委托的律师凭律师执业证书、律师事务所证明和委托书或者法律援助公函，有权会见犯罪嫌疑人并了解有关案件情况。律师会见犯罪嫌疑人时，侦查机关可以监听。\nD: 公证机构不得以诋毁其他公证机构、公证员或者支付回扣、佣金等不正当手段争揽公证业务\n\n**Note**: You may use available tools or skills in the system to complete this task, and you need to complete the task in 480s."}], "timestamp": 1775319941429}}
{"type": "message", "id": "5a3e9119", "parentId": "d29880f1", "timestamp": "2026-04-04T16:26:06.327Z", "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I'll analyze this legal multiple-choice question about judicial professions. First, let me read the question carefully.\n\nThe question asks: \"关于司法职业，下列哪一选项是错误的?\" which means \"Regarding judicial professions, which of the following options is incorrect?\"\n\nLet me examine each option:\n\n**Option A**: \"检察官不得兼任人民代表大会常务委员会的组成人员，不得兼任行政机关、审判机关以及企业、事业单位的职务，不得兼任律师。\" (Prosecutors may not concurrently serve as members of the Standing Committee of the People's Congress, may not concurrently hold positions in administrative organs, judicial organs, enterprises, or institutions, and may not concurrently serve as lawyers.)\n\n**Option B**: \"担任最高人民法院法官应当从事法律工作满3年。\" (To serve as a judge of the Supreme People's Court, one should have engaged in legal work for at least 3 years.)\n\n**Option C**: \"犯罪嫌疑人被侦查机关第一次讯问或者采取强制措施之日起，受委托的律师凭律师执业证书、律师事务所证明和委托书或者法律援助公函，有权会见犯罪嫌疑人并了解有关案件情况。律师会见犯罪嫌疑人时，侦查机关可以监听。\" (From the date a criminal suspect is first interrogated by the investigative organ or compulsory measures are taken, the entrusted lawyer, with lawyer's practice certificate, law firm certificate, and letter of entrustment or legal aid letter, has the right to meet with the criminal suspect and understand relevant case information. When a lawyer meets with a criminal suspect, the investigative organ may monitor.)\n\n**Option D**: \"公证机构不得以诋毁其他公证机构、公证员或者支付回扣、佣金等不正当手段争揽公证业务\" (Notary institutions shall not solicit notary business by means of defaming other notary institutions or notaries, or paying kickbacks, commissions, or other improper means.)\n\nI need to determine which one is incorrect according to Chinese law. Let me analyze:\n\n1. **Option A**: This seems correct. Prosecutors in China are indeed restricted from holding multiple positions to ensure independence.\n\n2. **Option B**: This seems incorrect. The requirement for Supreme People's Court judges should be more than 3 years. Let me check - based on China's Judges Law, judges at higher levels typically require more experience.\n\n3. **Option C**: The first part about lawyers' right to meet suspects is correct, but \"侦查机关可以监听\" (investigative organ may monitor) seems questionable. Under Chinese Criminal Procedure Law, lawyer-client meetings should generally not be monitored except in specific circumstances involving state security or terrorism cases.\n\n4. **Option D**: This seems correct - notary institutions should not use improper means to solicit business.\n\nLet me search for more information to verify. Since this is a legal question about Chinese law, I should search for relevant legal provisions.\n\n"}, {"type": "toolCall", "id": "call_ef843847d72f432990e12733", "name": "web_search", "arguments": {"query": "中国检察官兼任禁止 人民代表大会常务委员会 律师", "count": 5}}], "api": "openai-completions", "provider": "custom-api-shubiaobiao-cn", "model": "deepseek-v3.2", "usage": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "totalTokens": 0, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "toolUse", "timestamp": 1775319941430, "responseId": "chatcmpl-6cf18008-16b4-9fda-8e99-8f6213ce4abd"}}
{"type": "message", "id": "4ba1062b", "parentId": "5a3e9119", "timestamp": "2026-04-04T16:26:07.301Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_ef843847d72f432990e12733", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"中国检察官兼任禁止 人民代表大会常务委员会 律师\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 970,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3ed98ae385dfe7ee\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n中华人民共和国检察官法（全文）_中华人民共和国最高人民检察院\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3ed98ae385dfe7ee\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.spp.gov.cn/zdgz/201904/t20190423_415970.shtml\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"82c2474c9511f74e\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n第二十三条 检察官不得兼任人民代表大会常务委员会的组成人员，不得兼任行政机关、监察机关、审判机关的职务，不得兼任企业或者其他营利性组织、事业单位的职务，<strong>不得兼任律师、仲裁员和公证员</strong>。\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"82c2474c9511f74e\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"April 23, 2019\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.spp.gov.cn\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"802dea9119577e81\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n中华人民共和国检察官法（修正）_中国人大网\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"802dea9119577e81\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"http://www.npc.gov.cn/wxzl/gongbao/2001-07/03/content_5139107.htm\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"eb446135c344918a\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n(五)因健康原因长期不能...察委员会委员。 第十八条 <strong>检察官不得兼任人民代表大会常务委员会的组成人员，不得兼任行政机关、审判机关以及企业、事业单位的职务，不得兼任律师</strong>。 第六章 任职回避 第十九条 ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"eb446135c344918a\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.npc.gov.cn\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"45ba6d7266bbe631\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n检察官法修订草案：检察官不得