{"type": "message", "id": "d85f149c", "parentId": "31cdf3b4", "timestamp": "2026-04-04T16:27:32.677Z", "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "From the first result, it says: \"新《刑事诉讼法》第37条第四款规定：'……辩护律师会见犯罪嫌疑人、被告人不被监听。'\" (The new Criminal Procedure Law Article 37(4) states: \"...defense lawyers meeting with criminal suspects or defendants shall not be monitored.\")\n\nSo Option C says \"侦查机关可以监听\" (investigative organ may monitor), which contradicts the Criminal Procedure Law. This seems incorrect.\n\nNow let me check Option D about notary institutions.\n\n\n\n"}, {"type": "toolCall", "id": "call_ff359225049d44a4995c0c9b", "name": "web_search", "arguments": {"query": "公证机构不得以诋毁其他公证机构 支付回扣 不正当手段", "count": 5}}], "api": "openai-completions", "provider": "custom-api-shubiaobiao-cn", "model": "deepseek-v3.2", "usage": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "totalTokens": 0, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "toolUse", "timestamp": 1775320038795, "responseId": "chatcmpl-6ba66d5c-3935-95b7-a671-a2f83fbfd9f0"}}
{"type": "message", "id": "72ceb062", "parentId": "d85f149c", "timestamp": "2026-04-04T16:27:33.658Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_ff359225049d44a4995c0c9b", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"公证机构不得以诋毁其他公证机构 支付回扣 不正当手段\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 979,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"51f6641ed176f465\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n对公证机构及其公证员以诋毁其他公证机构、公证员或者支付回扣、佣金等不正当手段争揽公证业务的处罚\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"51f6641ed176f465\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://sfj.xlgl.gov.cn/sfj/zwgk/zfxxgk/fdzdnr/xzcf/2023041817113032875/index.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b5f5cb225f46463d\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n1.立案责任：发现公证机构及其公证员以诋毁其他公证机构、公证员或者支付回扣、佣金等不正当手段争揽公证业务的，予以审查，决定是否立案。 2、调查责任：对立案的案件，指定专人负责，及时组织调查取证，与当事人有直接利害关系的应当回避。执法人员不少于2人，调查时应出示执法证件，听取当事人辩解陈述并作记录。执法人员应保守有关秘密。 3、审查责任：审查案件调查报告，对案件违法事实、证据、调查取证程序、法律适用、处罚种类\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b5f5cb225f46463d\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"April 24, 2024\",\n      \"siteName\": \"sfj.xlgl.gov.cn\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8e3e82f0bc20ff02\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n对公证机构及其公证员以诋毁其他公证机构、公证员或者支付回扣、佣金等不正当手段争揽公证业务行为、违反规定的收费标准收取公证费、同时在二个以上公证机构执业、从事有报酬的其他职业、为本人及近亲属办理公证或者...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8e3e82f0bc20ff02\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://sfj.changdu.gov.cn/cdssfj/qzqdy/202203/b9dc96b0270641a48e072fa85495f9ae.shtml\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"71b82e49d7f057bc\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n【法律】《中华人民共和国公证法》（2017年修正版）第四十一条：公证机构及其公证员有下列行为之一的，由省、自治区、直辖市或者设区的市人民政府司法行政部门给予警告；情节严重的，对公证机构处一万元以上五万...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUST