{"type": "message", "id": "87926e0e", "parentId": "c47086d3", "timestamp": "2026-04-04T16:28:37.846Z", "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Interesting! The last result shows: \"高等院校法律专业本科毕业或者高等院校非法律专业本科毕业具有法律专业知识，从事法律工作满二年，其中担任高级人民法院、最高人民法院法官，应当从事法律工作满三年\" (Graduates of law majors at institutions of higher education or graduates of non-law majors at institutions of higher education with legal professional knowledge should have engaged in legal work for at least 2 years; among them, those serving as judges of High People's Courts or the Supreme People's Court should have engaged in legal work for at least 3 years.)\n\nThis suggests that Option B might actually be correct according to an older version of the law! But I need to check the current law. The 2019 revised Judges Law likely changed this.\n\nLet me check the current Judges Law more carefully.\n\n\n\n"}, {"type": "toolCall", "id": "call_679c94763dbc4e778e7db0c3", "name": "web_fetch", "arguments": {"url": "http://legal.people.com.cn/n1/2019/0728/c42510-31259763.html"}}], "api": "openai-completions", "provider": "custom-api-shubiaobiao-cn", "model": "deepseek-v3.2", "usage": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "totalTokens": 0, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "toolUse", "timestamp": 1775320097427, "responseId": "chatcmpl-caaeb1b5-7c0f-9f23-b8d1-1099686c6e78"}}
