{"type": "message", "id": "a1df1129", "parentId": "ae9fb06a", "timestamp": "2026-04-04T16:29:26.833Z", "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The text is garbled (encoding issues). Let me search for the specific article about years of legal work experience.\n\nBased on my search results, I can see that the current Judges Law (2019) requires \"从事法律工作满五年\" (engage in legal work for at least 5 years), with possible relaxation to 4 or 3 years for those with higher degrees. But Option B specifically says \"担任最高人民法院法官应当从事法律工作满3年\" (To serve as a judge of the Supreme People's Court, one should have engaged in legal work for at least 3 years).\n\nThis seems incorrect because:\n1. The general requirement is 5 years, not 3 years\n2. Even with a PhD (which allows reduction to 3 years), it's not \"应当从事法律工作满3年\" (should have engaged in legal work for at least 3 years) for all Supreme People's Court judges - only for those with specific higher degrees\n\nHowever, I found an older version of the law that said Supreme People's Court judges need 3 years. So the question might be testing knowledge of the current law vs. old law.\n\nBut Option C seems clearly wrong based on the Criminal Procedure Law. Let me think about this carefully.\n\nActually, looking at the question again: \"关于司法职业，下列哪一选项是错误的?\" This is a typical Chinese legal exam question. In such exams:\n\n1. Option A is from Prosecutor's Law Article 23 - correct\n2. Option B - Supreme People's Court judges need at least 5 years of legal work experience according to current law (2019 Judges Law), not 3 years\n3. Option C - \"侦查机关可以监听\" is wrong according to Criminal Procedure Law Article 39 (formerly 37)\n4. Option D is from Notarization Law Article 41 - correct\n\nSo both B and C seem wrong. But which one is MORE clearly wrong? Let me analyze:\n\nFor Option B: There might be confusion because in the old Judges Law (2001), it said Supreme People's Court judges need 3 years. But the current law (2019) changed it to 5 years (with possible reductions for higher degrees). So this could be a trick question testing knowledge of the current law.\n\nFor Option C: This is clearly wrong. The Criminal Procedure Law explicitly states \"辩护律师会见犯罪嫌疑人、被告人时不被监听\" (defense lawyers meeting with criminal suspects or defendants shall not be monitored).\n\nActually, wait. Let me re-read Option C carefully: \"犯罪嫌疑人被侦查机关第一次讯问或者采取强制措施之日起，受委托的律师凭律师执业证书、律师事务所证明和委托书或者法律援助公函，有权会见犯罪嫌疑人并了解有关案件情况。律师会见犯罪嫌疑人时，侦查机关可以监听.\"\n\nThe first part is correct. The second part \"侦查机关可以监听\" is incorrect. This is definitely wrong.\n\nGiven that this is a multiple-choice question asking for \"哪一选项是错误的\" (which option is incorrect), and only one should be incorrect, I believe Option C is the incorrect one.\n\nHowever, I should confirm about Option B. Let me search for the exact current Judges Law provision.\n\n\n\n"}, {"type": "toolCall", "id": "call_135dd23f28474c4db31b430c", "name": "web_search", "arguments": {"query": "\"从事法律工作满五年\" \"最高人民法院法官\"", "count": 5}}], "api": "openai-completions", "provider": "custom-api-shubiaobiao-cn", "model": "deepseek-v3.2", "usage": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "totalTokens": 0, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "toolUse", "timestamp": 1775320118346, "responseId": "chatcmpl-e7e7c219-5d31-98a6-8487-3ffe3a9a06e5"}}
{"type": "message", "id": "f9cae878", "parentId": "a1df1129", "timestamp": "2026-04-04T16:29:27.685Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_135dd23f28474c4db31b430c", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"\\\"从事法律工作满五年\\\" \\\"最高人民法院法官\\\"\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 2,\n  \"tookMs\": 850,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2f512085ba58fb92\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n中华人民共和国法官法 - 中华人民共和国最高人民法院公报\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2f512085ba58fb92\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"http://gongbao.court.gov.cn/Details/10184ac6ae4b7aaadff9730c03342b.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2730851949146dd7\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n（六）从事法律工作满五年。其中获得法律硕士、法学硕士学位，或者获得法学博士学位的，从事法律工作的年限可以分别放宽至四年、三年； · （七）初任法官应当通过国家统一法律职业资格考试取得法律职业资格。 · 适用前款第五项规定的学历条件确有困难的地方，经最高人民法院审核确定，在一定期限内，可以将担任法官的学历条件放宽为高等学校本科毕业。\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2730851949146dd7\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"gongbao.court.gov.cn\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"9154c122195f955c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n中华人民共和国法官法（2019 年修订） 正文 中华人民共和国主席令 第二十七号 《中华人民共和国法官法》已由中华人民共和国第十三届全国人民代表大会\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"9154c122195f955c\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://fgw.sh.gov.cn/cmsres/ba/ba3e00dc12b746e2b976406314cf6e0f/efd8e542836561fe73c3d4b87b57fd82.pdf\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0a935358a4f355c0\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n（六）从事法律工作满五年。其中获得法律硕士、法学硕士学位，或者获得 · 法学博士学位的，从事法律工作的年限可以分别放宽至四年、三年； · （七）初任法官应当通过国家统一法律职业资格考试取得法律职业资格。 · 适用前款第五项规定的学历条件确有困难的地方，经最高人民法院审核确定 ·\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0a935358a4f355c0\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"fgw.sh.gov.cn\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}], "details": {"query": "\"从事法律工作满五年\" \"最高人民法院法官\"", "provider": "brave", "count": 2, "tookMs": 850, "externalContent": {"untrusted": true, "source": "web_search", "provider": "brave", "wrapped": true}, "results": [{"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"2f512085ba58fb92\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n中华人民共和国法官法 - 中华人民共和国最高人民法院公报\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"2f512085ba58fb92\">>>", "url": "http://gongbao.court.gov.cn/Details/10184ac6ae4b7aaadff9730c03342b.html", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"2730851949146dd7\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n（六）从事法律工作满五年。其中获得法律硕士、法学硕士学位，或者获得法学博士学位的，从事法律工作的年限可以分别放宽至四年、三年； · （七）初任法官应当通过国家统一法律职业资格考试取得法律职业资格。 · 适用前款第五项规定的学历条件确有困难的地方，经最高人民法院审核确定，在一定期限内，可以将担任法官的学历条件放宽为高等学校本科毕业。\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"2730851949146dd7\">>>", "siteName": "gongbao.court.gov.cn"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"9154c122195f955c\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n中华人民共和国法官法（2019 年修订） 正文 中华人民共和国主席令 第二十七号 《中华人民共和国法官法》已由中华人民共和国第十三届全国人民代表大会\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"9154c122195f955c\">>>", "url": "https://fgw.sh.gov.cn/cmsres/ba/ba3e00dc12b746e2b976406314cf6e0f/efd8e542836561fe73c3d4b87b57fd82.pdf", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"0a935358a4f355c0\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n（六）从事法律工作满五年。其中获得法律硕士、法学硕士学位，或者获得 · 法学博士学位的，从事法律工作的年限可以分别放宽至四年、三年； · （七）初任法官应当通过国家统一法律职业资格考试取得法律职业资格。 · 适用前款第五项规定的学历条件确有困难的地方，经最高人民法院审核确定 ·\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"0a935358a4f355c0\">>>", "siteName": "fgw.sh.gov.cn"}]}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1775320167684}}
{"type": "message", "id": "f78a8027", "parentId": "f9cae878", "timestamp": "2026-04-04T16:29:59.534Z", "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The current law says \"从事法律工作满五年\" (engage in legal work for at least 5 years), with possible relaxation to 3 years for those with a PhD. But Option B says \"应当从事法律工作满3年\" (should have engaged in legal work for at least 3 years) without qualification. This is incorrect.\n\nBut actually, looking more carefully: Option B says \"担任最高人民法院法官应当从事法律工作满3年\" - this is stating it as a general requirement for all Supreme People's Court judges, which is wrong. The law says 5 years generally, with possible reduction to 3 years only for those with a PhD.\n\nSo Option B is also incorrect. But which one is THE incorrect answer the question expects?\n\nLet me think about typical Chinese legal exam patterns. Often they test:\n- Option C is a common trap - mixing correct and incorrect statements\n- The \"可以监听\" (may monitor) part is clearly against the current law\n\nActually, I recall that there was an older version of the Criminal Procedure Law that allowed monitoring in certain circumstances, but the 2012 revision changed it to \"不被监听\" (shall not be monitored). So Option C is definitely wrong under current law.\n\nGiven that this is asking for \"哪一选项是错误的\" (which option is incorrect), and based on my analysis:\n\n- Option A: Correct (Prosecutor's Law)\n- Option B: Incorrect (should be 5 years, not 3 years, for Supreme People's Court judges)\n- Option C: Incorrect (lawyer meetings should not be monitored)\n- Option D: Correct (Notarization Law)\n\nBut wait, I need to check if Option B might be correct according to some interpretation. Let me search more specifically.\n\n\n\n"}, {"type": "toolCall", "id": "call_09bf1bef964f494d952bf77f", "name": "web_search", "arguments": {"query": "\"担任最高人民法院法官应当从事法律工作满3年\"", "count": 5}}], "api": "openai-completions", "provider": "custom-api-shubiaobiao-cn", "model": "deepseek-v3.2", "usage": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "totalTokens": 0, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "toolUse", "timestamp": 1775320167686, "responseId": "chatcmpl-43071c18-719e-956f-89dc-990ef866a102"}}
{"type": "message", "id": "5c1e045e", "parentId": "f78a8027", "timestamp": "2026-04-04T16:30:00.366Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_09bf1bef964f494d952bf77f", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"\\\"担任最高人民法院法官应当从事法律工作满3年\\\"\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 0,\n  \"tookMs\": 830,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": []\n}"}], "details": {"query": "\"担任最高人民法院法官应当从事法律工作满3年\"", "provider": "brave", "count": 0, "tookMs": 830, "externalContent": {"untrusted": true, "source": "web_search", "provider": "brave", "wrapped": true}, "results": []}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1775320200365}}
{"type": "message", "id": "9cf70960", "parentId": "5c1e045e", "timestamp": "2026-04-04T16:30:21.132Z", "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "No results. Let me think about this systematically. In Chinese legal exams, they often test common mistakes. The \"律师会见犯罪嫌疑人时，侦查机关可以监听\" mistake is a classic one that many students get wrong because they remember the old law or confuse it with other provisions.\n\nActually, I should check if there are any exceptions to the \"不被监听\" rule. Are there any cases where monitoring is allowed?\n\n\n\n"}, {"type": "toolCall", "id": "call_336c82861c4c451cba3f0f4d", "name": "web_search", "arguments": {"query": "律师会见 不被监听 例外 情形", "count": 5}}], "api": "openai-completions", "provider": "custom-api-shubiaobiao-cn", "model": "deepseek-v3.2", "usage": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "totalTokens": 0, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "toolUse", "timestamp": 1775320200367, "responseId": "chatcmpl-48137e3e-dd6d-9506-bc98-fc68f32f56e3"}}
{"type": "message", "id": "ed403217", "parentId": "9cf70960", "timestamp": "2026-04-04T16:30:22.117Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_336c82861c4c451cba3f0f4d", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"律师会见 不被监听 例外 情形\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 984,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"21000219b9f610bb\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n《关于提讯、会见看守所在押犯罪嫌疑人、被告人、罪犯的若干规定》 - 网络资源\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"21000219b9f610bb\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"http://www.szlawyers.com/info/7307885d19b3f83485462f01fc703fda\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"47b929e8f9c0399a\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n第十条 律师不得在共同犯罪案件中会见2个及以上犯罪嫌疑人或被告人。律师会见在押人员，不被监听。\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"47b929e8f9c0399a\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.szlawyers.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"dc08b85ac3c69489\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n第632期:律师会见犯罪嫌疑人时需要注意哪些问题？\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"dc08b85ac3c69489\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.bj148.org/fw/xzsc/wnzz/201811/t20181126_1458083.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"44f12d6410fda76e\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n会见未被关押的犯罪嫌疑人，可以在其住所、单位或者律师事务所进行。会见时其他人不应在场，但犯罪嫌疑人是未成年人或着盲、聋、哑人的，律师会见时其法定代理人或者近亲属应该在场。且律师会见时，不被监听。\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"44f12d6410fda76e\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.bj148.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c8c54df9cfe68928\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n律师会见在押犯新规印发：会见被侦查起诉在押罪犯时不被监听_法治中国_澎湃新闻-The Paper\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c8c54df9cfe68928\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_1899492\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"27669c7b2ca822bb\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n新规第十一条规定，律师会见在押罪犯时，监狱可以根据案件情况和工作需要决定是否派警察在场。辩护律师会见被立案侦查、起诉、审判的在押罪犯时，不被监听，监狱不得派警察在场。徐昕认为，在押罪犯被侦查、起诉、审判的情况包括发现漏罪或新的罪行，或者决定立案再审等情况。这意味着就新的案件而言，在押罪犯仍未定罪，与看守所见会嫌疑人相关规定保持了一致。\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"27669c7b2ca822bb\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.thepaper.cn\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"179dd6e792412e7f\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n中国司法部：律师见在押犯不得被监听\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"179dd6e792412e7f\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.rfa.org/mandarin/yataibaodao/renquanfazhi/hc-12112017105331.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0866bd7a27d56f8b\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n“第二，以前虽然也有规定不得监听律师和在押犯的会见，但是没有十分明确。这次（司法部）还特别表明，警察不能出现在会见现场。第三，中国刑法已经规定，律师在看守所会见嫌疑犯时警方不得监听。司法部新规定是这一条例的延伸。这对辩护律师来说是一个利好，是中国司法制度的一个进步。” · 中国司法部的新《规定》还明确，律师会见在押罪犯时，监狱可以根据案件情况和工作需要决定是否派警察在场。辩护律师会见被立案侦查、起诉、审判的在押罪犯时，不被监听。监狱也不得派警察在会见现场。\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0866bd7a27d56f8b\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.rfa.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2798bee181131510\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n律师不被监听，保护的是什么？-虎嗅网\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2798bee181131510\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://m.huxiu.com/article/2791772.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3e49ed00292b9e67\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n但作为法学院的老师，给学生们上课的时，我们还会加上一句：“不被监听，也要确保每一句话经得起监听的考验。”教室里这些未来的律师们，频频点头发笑。 · 他们也许知道，2019年曾经发生过一起著名的“隔墙有耳”案：江西一名律师在看守所会见当事人时，隔壁正好是办案民警。事后办案民警以证人身份作证，这位律师被控以辩护人伪造证据罪，一时间引起法学界的激烈讨论。次年，当地检方以“情节显著轻微，危害不大“为由，撤回了起诉。\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3e49ed00292b9e67\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"March 16, 2024\",\n      \"siteName\": \"m.huxiu.com\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}]